#: mounthelper/kio_media_mounthelper.cpp:131
#: mounthelper/kio_media_mounthelper.cpp:156
msgid ""
"\n"
"Please check that the disk is entered correctly."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"សូម​ពិនិត្យ​មើល​ថា ថាស​ត្រូវ​បាន​បញ្ចូល​ត្រឹម​ត្រូវ ។"

#: mounthelper/kio_media_mounthelper.cpp:136
#: mounthelper/kio_media_mounthelper.cpp:161
msgid ""
"\n"
"Please check that the device is plugged correctly."
